<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-early-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength of Gasterosteus doryssus_early at 33 µm (10.02 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The module docstring states the PDE, the dispersion law, and the ocellus readout. The math-KG loop file points at the Jacobian, sigma(k), and the Lean theorems (six theorems, zero sorry). Deduction: Lean was not executed in this image (-6); k_img = 6 is a pixel-grid constant of the GIF, documented as such, and is easy to mistake for k_c (-4). The docstring states the distinction." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
